l components provided by MISO. It contains also "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views. These are inherited from OUDS."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents","type":"topic"}}}